OL,3,AItaly overhauls electoral system after
OL,4,Afiercely contested debate
OL,5,
OL,6,FItaly's parliament has approved
OL,7,Ffiercely contested changes to the
OL,8,Fcountry's electoral system championed
OL,9,Fby Prime Minister Giorgia Meloni ahead
OL,10,Fof elections due next year.
OL,12,FLawmakers voted 227 to 164 in favour of
OL,13,Fmoving to a fully proportional system,
OL,14,Fwhich Meloni has argued will boost the
OL,15,Fchance of clear winners and more stable
OL,16,Fgovernment.
OL,18,FOpposition parties say her right-wing
OL,19,Fcoalition has designed the proposals to
OL,20,Fimprove its chance of retaining power
OL,21,Fand, in a heated debate on Thursday,
OL,22,Faccused it of flouting democracy.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
